  "dependencies": {
    "daily": "last: claims newly completed tasks from earlier actions",
    "intel_cycle": "Game execute-all for ordinary intel; repeat after claim. Event firebeast separate; meal lighthouse step before intelligence.",
    "execution_order": "Stable core first; new/repaired or unresolved exit/branch actions in tail, preserving business dependencies. daily remains final progress claim. Tail position does not make an action validated.",
    "npc_rally_start": "One explicit visit attempt before gathering; daily target10 own-initiator victories is tracked by campaign evidence, not by macro pass or autojoin. Additional bounded attempts may interleave daily chunks.",
    "academy": "Current live free Trek Supplies at UTC08/20, ten each. Settle completed travel before claiming supply; then start idle travel with available stock. A running trip is closed, never ended early.",
    "enlistment": "Repaired hospital entry moved to development tail, before daily; no dependency on research/construction upgrades. Partial batch recovery continues untouched tasks rather than repeating earlier components.",
    "travel_idle": "When all three are eligible, travel_idle_claim → academy → travel_idle. Supply collection precedes a fresh start; neither a running queue nor a zero-stock skip proves completed trips.",
    "labyrinth_challenge": "Daily challenge is independent of raids. Select one actually visible known domain label and verify its battle page; never assume Cave of Monsters is open all week. Known labels Cave, Earthlab, Forge; unsupported domains remain explicit coverage gaps."
  },
